<title>USA: Technology Solutions sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Technology Solutions sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Solutions Co said Thursday its board had approved a three-for-two stock split, payable August 1, record July 10.</p>
</text>
